The project jobs in .github/workflows/bench.yml and the hardware job in .github/workflows/hw.yml
are adapted from an open-source GitHub Actions runner benchmark suite, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0, which carries this notice:

   Copyright 2026 Vitko Inc.

Changes made here: the jobs were gathered into one workflow with a choice of runner class and four
lanes; steps and inputs that only enabled one vendor's optional features (cache sidecars, layer-cache
builders, warm starts and split test runs) were removed; one unpinned action was pinned to a commit.
The commands that build and test each project are unchanged.

Each job is in turn adapted from the named project's own CI workflow, at the commit given in the job.
The projects are named only to identify the code that was built; none of them is affiliated with or
endorses this benchmark.
